{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A NEW DIMENSION IN HYBRID SPORTS ACTION</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIRD PERSON CAMERA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim and shoot the ball with precision, using angles and trajectories to dive into the heart of the action from an immersive viewpoint.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYER &amp; BALL CONTROL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the action, position yourself, run, jump, and execute precision shots with chips and spins. Use your dash to shoulder the ball with power or dribble in close.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SKILL-BASED MULTI-SPORTS BALL SHOOTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 1v1 or 2v2 in hybrid sports showdowns. From tennis to soccer, you\u2019ll shoot for goals\u2014not kills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871040/extras/62b669ba6f7926e0d56628b4adb5c1f6.avif?t=1759488667\" width=1520 height=1080 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONLINE TEAM-BASED EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAM-BASED ONLINE GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BZK Ball fuses precision shooting with athletic tactics, demanding split-second reactions and mastery of fair, unique ball physics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871040/extras/988e8e47766fb0397df9b369df5ab54c.avif?t=1759488667\" width=1520 height=1080 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICS &amp; CREATIVITY</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PICK THE RIGHT EQUIPMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose gear that matches your tactics and skills. From multi-shots and grappling hooks to defensive walls, each tool demands skill to master. Balance your loadout and your team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDLESS THRILL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Forget fouls and offsides\u2014these robotic athletes keep the action pumping. Easy to learn, exciting to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871040/extras/95e54231ca400a13de1e06431cc17ed6.avif?t=1759488667\" width=1520 height=1080 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871040?t=1759488667","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871040?t=1759488667","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871040/3c838472e76a8cbbc65d86aff79ddb77c6bff4f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759488667","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871040/3c838472e76a8cbbc65d86aff79ddb77c6bff4f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759488667","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A NEW DIMENSION IN HYBRID SPORTS ACTION</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIRD PERSON CAMERA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim and shoot the ball with precision, using angles and trajectories to dive into the heart of the action from an immersive viewpoint.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYER &amp; BALL CONTROL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the action, position yourself, run, jump, and execute precision shots with chips and spins. Use your dash to shoulder the ball with power or dribble in close.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SKILL-BASED MULTI-SPORTS BALL SHOOTER</h2><p class=\"